{"title":"Comparative Advantage","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/923632901/0/marginalrevolution~Comparative-Advantage.html","date":1755861420000,"content":"<p>The excellent Don Boudreaux on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://mru.org/courses/principles-economics-microeconomics/comparative-advantage-definition-tasmania\">comparative advantage</a>, one of the deepest and most important ideas in economics.</p>\r\n<p>As a new semester begins this is a good reminder that <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://mru.org/\">MRU</a> has great videos for learning and teaching economics, all entirely free and open. (Of course, these videos pair delightfully with <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/our-textbook\">Modern Principles of Economics</a>).</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/08/comparative-advantage-2.html\">Comparative Advantage</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/923632901/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/923632901/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/923632901/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/923632901/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/923632901/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com